    "name": "Eternal Circus: Dancing with Missiles",
    "steam_appid": 3422310,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/0c6fb813768bccd4ba759863d767004b.avif?t=1749573297\" data-has-big width=800 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Circus is a top-down dodge'm up where you can become a nimble mech fighting bosses while dodging barrage of missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTMANEUVERING MISSILES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/93c2c5b3246b41046ea01bd3a31e729e.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/93c2c5b3246b41046ea01bd3a31e729e.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/93c2c5b3246b41046ea01bd3a31e729e.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mech can move and dash to avoid missiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EC DRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/34eeef919153d8361b224aa45d321eaa.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/34eeef919153d8361b224aa45d321eaa.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/34eeef919153d8361b224aa45d321eaa.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the pink EC meter is full, the player can engage the EC Drive. Time slows down considerably, so you have a second to breathe and think out your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAIN ENERGY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/0a9ac2d6304dc4b948a22b09f4664203.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/0a9ac2d6304dc4b948a22b09f4664203.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/0a9ac2d6304dc4b948a22b09f4664203.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodging enemy projectiles in EC Drive gives you Energy, which is required to attack the boss. The closer you get to missiles and other enemies, the more Energy you get, so riskier plays are rewarded with more Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MELEE ATTACK YOUR FOE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/29a560c25a3ebbafef2bdd001ac9fe9a.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/29a560c25a3ebbafef2bdd001ac9fe9a.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/29a560c25a3ebbafef2bdd001ac9fe9a.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have enough energy, approach your target to lock on and perform a melee attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/bcb7c8b9069b6c08602e0cc4adb1eda0.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=602 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/bcb7c8b9069b6c08602e0cc4adb1eda0.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/bcb7c8b9069b6c08602e0cc4adb1eda0.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss has unique attack patterns. Are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck out there o7</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/0c6fb813768bccd4ba759863d767004b.avif?t=1749573297\" data-has-big width=800 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Circus is a top-down dodge'm up where you can become a nimble mech fighting bosses while dodging barrage of missiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTMANEUVERING MISSILES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/93c2c5b3246b41046ea01bd3a31e729e.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/93c2c5b3246b41046ea01bd3a31e729e.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/93c2c5b3246b41046ea01bd3a31e729e.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mech can move and dash to avoid missiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EC DRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/34eeef919153d8361b224aa45d321eaa.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/34eeef919153d8361b224aa45d321eaa.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/34eeef919153d8361b224aa45d321eaa.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the pink EC meter is full, the player can engage the EC Drive. Time slows down considerably, so you have a second to breathe and think out your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAIN ENERGY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/0a9ac2d6304dc4b948a22b09f4664203.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/0a9ac2d6304dc4b948a22b09f4664203.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/0a9ac2d6304dc4b948a22b09f4664203.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodging enemy projectiles in EC Drive gives you Energy, which is required to attack the boss. The closer you get to missiles and other enemies, the more Energy you get, so riskier plays are rewarded with more Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MELEE ATTACK YOUR FOE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/29a560c25a3ebbafef2bdd001ac9fe9a.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/29a560c25a3ebbafef2bdd001ac9fe9a.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/29a560c25a3ebbafef2bdd001ac9fe9a.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have enough energy, approach your target to lock on and perform a melee attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/bcb7c8b9069b6c08602e0cc4adb1eda0.poster.avif?t=1749573297\" width=602 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/bcb7c8b9069b6c08602e0cc4adb1eda0.webm?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422310/extras/bcb7c8b9069b6c08602e0cc4adb1eda0.mp4?t=1749573297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss has unique attack patterns. Are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck out there o7</p>",
